Work as described in `AGENTS.md` at the repository root:

- Read `europe-city-culture-planner/SKILL.md` (workflow) and `europe-city-culture-planner/profile.md` (the user's taste).
- Write `plans/<city>-<yyyy-mm>.json` following `europe-city-culture-planner/schema/city.schema.json`; see `europe-city-culture-planner/examples/london-2027-03.json`.
- Render with `node europe-city-culture-planner/scripts/render.mjs plans/<file>.json`; never hand-write HTML.
